    <data key="d0">Talabat Migrating On-Premise Workloads to EKS, Lambda, and Beanstalk</data>
    <data key="d1">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=R_I_Uve-Fsk</data>
    <data key="d2">Architectural overview of Talabat's digital transformation, migrating on-premise applications and databases to AWS using EKS, Lambda, Beanstalk, Aurora, and EC2 with Route 53 managing traffic shifting.</data>
    <data key="d3">Migration</data>
    <data key="d4">True</data>
